# This widget derives 14, 7, 7, 3 from the 8x8 torus Laplacian
# spectrum, with no fitted parameters.
#
#   - 14: solutions of cos(pi*n1/4) + cos(pi*n2/4) = 0.
#   - 7 + 7: chiral split by sign(cos(pi*n1/4) - cos(pi*n2/4)),
#            with a secondary rule for the 4 zero-difference modes.
#   - 3: number of distinct |cos| values on Z_8, i.e.,
#        {0, sqrt(2)/2, 1}.
